{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllListItemComponentTokensProvider","doc:\/\/OUDSTokensComponent\/documentation\/OUDSTokensComponent\/ListItemComponentTokens","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/TokensProvider"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Class","externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B36ThemeListItemComponentTokensProviderC","symbolKind":"class","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"iPadOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"macOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"tvOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"visionOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"11.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"watchOS"}],"title":"OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component tokens"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for list item components like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSListItem"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSmallListItem"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllListItemComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ListItemComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for list item components through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Such component tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of sizes (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"borders (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"), colors (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spaces (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"), opacities (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and dimensions (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/init(sizes:borders:colors:spaces:opacities:dimensions:)"],"title":"Initializers"},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/borders","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/colors","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/dimensions","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/opacities","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/sizes","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/spaces"],"title":"Instance Properties"},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/ListItemComponentTokens-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/TokensProvider-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemelistitemc